Still 1.2.0. Pocket mode now notices a headset on Android too.

The route code does not move when a headset connects or drops — while listening, the microphone is the phone's own either way — so Android swallowed the news and pocket mode sat in the wrong half of itself: connected and never handing over to listening, or gone with the microphone left closed.

Android route changes also reach the log in Diagnostics now, with its copy button, instead of only logcat.
